---
// Testimonials2: one large centred pull-quote with avatar, name and customer logo.
---

<section class="bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <figure class="mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center text-center">
      <img src="/media/logo-fathom.svg" alt="Fathom" height="28" loading="lazy" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-80 dark:invert" />
      <blockquote class="mt-10">
        <p class="font-display text-3xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl lg:leading-tight">“We used to plan the work, then spend the week explaining the plan. With Halcyon the plan explains itself, and my team got their afternoons back.”</p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
        <img src="/media/avatar-4.svg" alt="Portrait of Ingrid Solberg" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy" class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover ring-4 ring-bg" />
        <div>
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-fg">Ingrid Solberg</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Chief Operating Officer, Fathom</p>
        </div>
      </figcaption>
      <a href="/about" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 transition hover:text-brand-700 dark:text-brand-400 dark:hover:text-brand-300">
        <span>Read how Fathom runs a 30-person team on Halcyon</span>
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14" />
          <path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
